  },
  "premium": {
   "root_cause": "(i) prem_nifty_weekly.json was built by daily2leg/fetch_weekly.py on a 10:00-15:15 grid by construction (its book entered at 10:00) - the 09:15-09:55 bars were discarded at build time; prem_nifty.json covers only contracts the R-programmes fetched. (ii) november_shadow_fetch.fetch_premium cached every fetched series only under a day-before-expiry filename in november_shadow_data/, which no shared consumer reads (verified before fix: BANKNIFTY 60800PE 2026-11-13 cached there, oi_buildup_score.store_bars returned None).",
   "fix": "mirror_shared() in november_shadow_fetch.py: write-once mirror into oi_buildup_data/ (shared convention, expiry-before-day) on the CACHED, fresh-fetch and expired-route paths + --backfill-shared one-time mirror.",
